	Ok , I'm going to try this one more time , if you've read it already
then I apologise, but here we go...

	Why not split the WoP into several different wands. One for 
polymorphing armour , one for weapons , one for gems , one for food , one 
for scrolls etc (or perhaps one for all magical items) and one for polying
living creatures (fun times when you engrave with it and "the bugs on the 
ground ... polymorph into a minotaur!!!!!!).

	The adavantages of this would be that you can still polypile to 
your hearts content so long as you have all the wands , if you only have a 
few of the wands then you can only polymorph a few sets of things!

	This sort of limits the polypiling abuse (??) (I think it's fun!)
but still allows a determined player to get the present power of the WOP.
However it can still be useful to the casual polymorpher.

	So what do you think?? Suggestions?


